                    %mi Y
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f \colon X \to Y
              of sequential prespectra is a collection
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
