            %p Then applying the same isomorphism diagonally once more gives a further bijection to commuting diagrams of this form:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
